?</p></span></div><div data-rid="2c512ecf-d6c6-470d-a170-b734e764805c" class="r-1ce66q7" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-1wtb7yu" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1.646 4.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0L8 10.293l5.646-5.647a.5.5 0 0 1 .708.708l-6 6a.5.5 0 0 1-.708 0l-6-6a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:Rddb2:"><div data-rid="5dc4fb3a-ae7f-4c01-a5c4-ed2173601200" class="r-wzk75i"><div data-rid="da947a57-0a9a-4fa6-a65b-0ff9bf673e0d" class="r-18u38rt alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Yes — the £5 discount can’t be combined with other promotions or sale codes. It applies only to full-price items. </p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="517873a4-24ab-4c39-9f04-dad71f33622e" class="r-1ixn0fq"></div><div data-rid="d954d9d3-9394-4dc8-a76e-8279f5a60961" class="r-ng6zar" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="9a035880-0089-43af-a572-97b6cd76daaa" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rhdb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-mqvkk2"><div data-rid="39a4d9c4-db9e-4f18-9b1b-1d5badf5b7da" class="r-1mcvriq alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Is there a limit to how many friends I can refer?</p></span></div><div data-rid="b01a459b-b1aa-4e90-a696-9d036f601a1d" class="r-cmfjfe" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-1f96y4h" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1.646 4.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0L8 10.293l5.646-5.647a.5.5 0 0 1 .708.708l-6 6a.5.5 0 0 1-.708 0l-6-6a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708"></path></svg></div></d